	(text_box "Pack connector J101 (keyed, Molex Mini-Fit Jr 2x4): two contacts each for + and -, mid-point, two cell NTCs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(size 184.76 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b2a2d93f-002a-5ab7-8e35-190921b5ef4e")
	)
	(text_box "Pack = 2 x Molicel INR-18650-P28A in series with an NTC on each cell, made by a pack assembler (design §B1.1). Keyed housing instead of a reverse-polarity MOSFET\n(design §B1.1: a series MOSFET would cost 0.2-0.4 W at 21 A peaks).\nCurrent per contact: 9.2 A average / 21 A peak (design §B4.2) shared by two contacts = 4.6 A / 10.5 A each. Mini-Fit Jr terminals are rated 9 A (standard) to 13 A\n(HCS) per circuit [BK, Molex drawing not read: VERIFY terminal rating and wire gauge].\nPin 8 returns both NTCs to BAT_NEG (device ground of U101). The mid-point (pin 3) feeds the gauge's cell sense here and must also reach U201 MID/CBSET on\n02_power_dock: no contract net exists for that (contract issue C-1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(size 184.76 14.954)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "65f53f84-7e6f-5942-a7f8-a5b77ba99fc2")
	)
	(text_box "U101 MAX17320G20 protector + gauge: 2S wiring (CELL1 = CELL2 = CELL3 = mid-point), high-side CHG/DIS N-FETs, 2 mOhm sense"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230.48 25.4 0)
		(size 208.28 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
