				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6ea9b3ed-9998-509a-b0ba-c7612e9b6c52")
	)
	(text_box "2S wiring per datasheet Figure 23: BATTS = top of stack through RBAL; CELL1, CELL2 and CELL3 joined on the pin side of RBAL to the mid-point ('short for 2S', 'short for 2S or 3S')\n[read from the figure graphic: VERIFY]. RBAL = 100 ohm: balancing current CELL1 = 4.2/(100+9) = 39 mA, BATTS = 4.2/(2x100+9) = 20 mA (datasheet formulas, RSWITCH 9 ohm typ), < 100 mA\npin limit; 0.15 W in R105/R106 -> 1206 0.25 W.\nIN: 10 ohm from the top of stack + 0.1 uF/25 V; CP: 0.47 uF/25 V to IN; REG3, REG2: 0.47 uF/10 V; CHG FET gate-source 0.1 uF (all per the pin table). PCKP: 1 k to VBAT_PACK. PFAIL\nunused: 1 k to ground. AOLDO unused: 10 k to ground. ZVC open (zero-volt charging not used). TH3, TH4 unused: to ground.\nSense R101 = 2 mOhm (Bourns CSS2H-2512K-2L00F, 5 W): 9.2 A average -> 0.17 W; current register range +/-51.2 mV / 2 mOhm = +/-25.6 A covers the 21 A peak.\nPROTECTION THRESHOLDS (non-volatile configuration, R-16 coordination, contract §9): fast over-discharge ODTH = -70 mV = 35 A, OCDLY = 5 -> 70 us + 5 x 977 us = 4.96 ms; short circuit\nSCTH = -130 mV = 65 A, SCDLY = 2 -> 70 + 2 x 61 = 192 us (>= 100 us). Both are above everything a limited branch can draw (eFuse 13 A, regulator fuses 1/1/3 A, load test 10.5 A, coil\nboost 2 A).\n'Auto-retry': the MAX17320 releases an over-discharge / short-circuit fault when PCKP rises above 1 V while it sources 30 uA into PCKP, or when a charger is detected (datasheet\n'Overcurrent Protection'). That works only if VBAT_SYS carries no resistive load below about 33 kohm (1 V / 30 uA): every sheet on VBAT_SYS must keep that (capture notes). It is NOT a\ntimed retry [contract wording 'auto-retry' approximated].\nnConfig.COMMSH MUST be 0: with COMMSH = 1 the part shuts down (FETs off) when SCL and SDA are both held low, which is exactly the state of I2C_M_* with the main controller off (design\n§B11, F-10). Answers design §16 rank 17."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 230.48 31.75 0)
		(size 208.28 32.226)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
